 who knew and loved<br></div><div style="text-indent: -1em; padding-left: 1em;">
 but one.<br></div><div style="text-indent: -1em; padding-left: 1em;">
 <br></div><div style="text-indent: -1em; padding-left: 1em;">
 My father died in silence&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></div><div style="text-indent: -1em; padding-left: 1em;">
 loving creation<br></div><div style="text-indent: -1em; padding-left: 1em;">
 and well-defined response&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></div><div style="text-indent: -1em; padding-left: 1em;">
 he lived&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; still judgments&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></div><div style="text-indent: -1em; padding-left: 1em;">
